// Test the three runtime improvements

// Test 1: age_until with already-reached target
brew test1 from water, barley.
wait for 10 days.
taste test1.
age test1 until 5%.
toast "Test 1 passed".

// Test 3: Verify double semantics
brew test3 from water, barley.
wait for 5 days.
taste test3.
double test3 by 3.
toast "After doubling by 3".
taste test3.
